## Diagram 0a — One Core, Three Surfaces

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph SURF["Surfaces &mdash; thin adapters, no logic of their own"]
        UI["Web UI<br/><i>manual: test, validate, debug</i>"]
        CLI["CLI<br/><i>scriptable</i>"]
        MCP["MCP<br/><i>agent</i>"]
    end

    API["Local HTTP API<br/><i>one API, three clients</i>"]

    subgraph CORE["Core Service Layer &mdash; implemented ONCE"]
        S1["discover()"]
        S2["authenticate()"]
        S3["capture()"]
        S4["assembleProject()"]
        S5["generateCopy()"]
        S6["compose()"]
        S7["renderScene() / renderVideo()"]
        S8["validate()"]
        S9["package()"]
    end

    UI --> API
    CLI --> API
    MCP --> API
    API --> CORE

    RULE["Rule: a capability is built once in the core,<br/>then exposed by all three.<br/>An agent run that misbehaves is reproducible<br/>by hand &mdash; provably the same code path."]
    CORE -.-> RULE

    classDef surf fill:#1e3a5f,stroke:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    classDef core fill:#1f3d2f,stroke:#4ad48a,color:#fff
    class UI,CLI,MCP surf
    class S1,S2,S3,S4,S5,S6,S7,S8,S9 core
```

