## Diagram 0c — AI-Driven End-to-End Workflow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant A as AI Agent
    participant S as Skills
    participant M as MCP
    participant E as Engine

    U->>A: "Generate Store Assets for this application"
    A->>S: load store-assets-overview
    S-->>A: workflow + layer separation

    rect rgb(45,31,74)
    Note over A: INSPECT — understand the real app
    A->>A: read source, routes, UI labels, docs
    A->>M: list_screens(url)
    M->>E: discovery (sitemap + crawl + rank)
    E-->>M: ranked candidates
    M-->>A: screen list
    A->>A: select marketable screens
    end

    rect rgb(31,61,47)
    Note over A,E: CAPTURE — deterministic
    A->>M: capture_web_screen(screen, profile)
    M->>E: Playwright @ DPR 3
    E-->>M: raw PNG
    A->>M: capture_android_screen(screen)
    Note right of M: only for native UI /<br/>WebView divergence
    M->>E: adb screencap
    E-->>M: raw PNG
    end

    rect rgb(45,31,74)
    Note over A: ANALYSE & WRITE — the differentiator
    A->>A: screenshot + source code → identify real feature
    A->>A: write headline / description / CTA
    Note right of A: grounded in actual code,<br/>never invented
    A->>M: set_screen_copy(screen, headline, desc, cta)
    end

    rect rgb(31,61,47)
    Note over A,E: RENDER — deterministic
    A->>M: create_mockup / create_marketing_image
    A->>M: create_video_scene(scene)
    M->>E: interpret template scene graph
    E-->>M: scene preview
    A->>M: create_video()
    E-->>M: promo.mp4
    end

    rect rgb(74,31,31)
    Note over A,E: REVIEW & ITERATE
    A->>M: preview_asset(...)
    M-->>A: low-res preview
    A->>A: "text too long" / "scene too slow"
    A->>M: update_scene(id, duration)
    Note right of M: re-renders ONE scene,<br/>not the whole project
    A->>M: validate_package()
    M->>E: rules engine + ffprobe
    E-->>M: report.json
    end

    M-->>A: validated package
    A->>U: preview + summary
    U->>A: approve
    A->>M: package_assets()
    M-->>U: Final Store Asset Package
```

